<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Northern Telecom raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Northern Telecom raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said it upgraded Northern Telecom Ltd to long-term buy from accumulate.</p>
<p>-- said kept Northern Telecom as near-term accumulate.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
</text>
